OL,3,GNEWSA'Dogs only swimming pool' and
OL,4,A'wobbly socials'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local news websites in the
OL,8,FWest of England.
OL,10,FA long-running proposal to expand the
OL,11,FWest's largest pig slaughterhouse near
OL,12,FWesterleigh has been delayed for months
OL,13,Ffollowing widespread opposition,
OL,14,Faccording to The Bristol Post.
OL,15,FThousands of objections have been
OL,16,Fsubmitted over plans to boost capacity
OL,17,Ffrom 19,000 to 25,000 pigs a week.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
